  licenses/pytorch-LICENSE, with the third-party notices of PyTorch's own
  source in licenses/pytorch-NOTICE (both from the v2.14.0 tag; the zip
  carries no licence text).
  https://github.com/pytorch/pytorch/tree/v2.14.0
  https://download.pytorch.org/libtorch/cpu/libtorch-shared-with-deps-2.14.0%2Bcpu.zip

